{"ts":"2026-07-24T23:43:03.056Z","author":"maintainer-agent","op":"create","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/body","value":"## Outcome\nThe pm SDK is a complete, documented, public API for repository-native project context. The CLI is one presentation layer over it; MCP is another; third parties can build a third.\n\n## Why this is a milestone, not an epic\npm-usfg is the living promotion epic. This milestone is the outcome gate that the universal-domain milestone and the GA semver surface both consume.\n\n## Delivery chain\nRemaining pm-usfg promotion slices -> boundary ratchet hardened to a failing gate -> authoring docs and exemplar -> pm-feecbs conformance gate can then measure external packages against a stable surface.\n\n## Explicit non-goals\nNot an API freeze — semver commitments belong to the GA milestone. Not a rewrite: promotion moves code, it does not redesign it."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-9rgaal"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"Outcome milestone: SDK-complete core — every CLI and MCP capability reachable from the public pm SDK"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":""},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Milestone"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":1},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["horizon:near-mid","milestone","outcome","platform","sdk","universal-tool"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-07-24T23:43:03.056Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-24T23:43:03.056Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/deadline","value":"2026-12-31T00:00:00.000Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"maintainer-agent"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":6000},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"SDK import-boundary baseline is zero and the ratchet is a hard failing gate, not an allowlist; Every remaining promotion slice under pm-usfg is closed with public exports and authoring docs; A published exemplar package implements a complete workflow using only public SDK exports, with no local shim; CLI and MCP handlers contain argument parsing, rendering, and no domain logic, proven by a structural test"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/goal","value":"sdk-complete-core"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/objective","value":"The CLI and MCP server contain presentation logic only; every primitive they use is public SDK surface"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/value","value":"The SDK is the product's leverage point: anything not in it cannot be reused, embedded, or extended by third parties."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/impact","value":"Unblocks the universal-platform milestone, the conformance gate for external packages, and any embedding of pm in another runtime."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/outcome","value":"The private-core import baseline is zero and hard-gated; a non-trivial third-party surface is buildable against published SDK exports alone."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/why_now","value":"Every new command shipped against private core widens the promotion backlog; the boundary ratchet only holds if the remaining slices land."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-doxj"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-feecbs","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-24T23:43:03.056Z"},{"id":"pm-m08hza","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-24T23:43:03.056Z"},{"id":"pm-m9xv","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-24T23:43:03.056Z"},{"id":"pm-muhw","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-24T23:43:03.056Z"},{"id":"pm-ugqx","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-24T23:43:03.056Z"},{"id":"pm-usfg","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-24T23:43:03.056Z"}]}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"8932bc27b04ec20cf79